      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_996cab19015a94d3a9f7b8fb_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The widget must export a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and not an instance of the class (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_1__) because it needs to be multiplied for each note, so that splits work correctly.",
      "sourceHash": "996cab19015a94d3a9f7b8fbd18131e148bbb781a6682e60ee34b74ccc25e72e",
      "context": "Note context aware widget",
      "contextHash": "38056d8742b2d4f4fce0e19f55548ded8e2a764925ff72e67fe97f75bbd76e36",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ウィジェットはクラスのインスタンスではなく __TRILIUM_PH_0__ をエクスポートする必要があります（例: __TRILIUM_PH_1__）。これは、分割表示が正常に機能するようにノートごとに複製する必要があるためです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c5dde00f00aabd9f8370d726_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Since the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ is exported instead of an instance, the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ getter must be __TRILIUM_PH_2__, otherwise the widget is ignored.",
      "sourceHash": "c5dde00f00aabd9f8370d726a97f28e396f484bc805b940aca612d1d0fd4eeb2",
      "context": "Note context aware widget",
      "contextHash": "38056d8742b2d4f4fce0e19f55548ded8e2a764925ff72e67fe97f75bbd76e36",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "インスタンスではなく __TRILIUM_PH_0__ がエクスポートされるため、__TRILIUM_PH_1__ ゲッターは __TRILIUM_PH_2__ でなければなりません。そうでない場合、ウィジェットは無視されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
